  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Art, for our Future</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2007, we have placed children at the heart of our intervention. Through weekly interventions in ZEP schools, in collaboration with engaged teachers, we create dynamic learning spaces that cater to the unique needs of vulnerable children. By integrating arts into academic subjects, we empower children with diverse backgrounds to thrive and succeed. Through art, children develop skills such as questioning, critical thinking, imagination, emotional control, and effective communication.</narrative>
  </description>
